Remove the third copy of the RH bridge and the unused kernel theorems.

CharacterBoxes/RiemannHypothesisOfEveryCharacter.lean held another
Mathlib-level derivation of RiemannHypothesis from UpperTheory.EveryCharacter
(zeta_ne_zero_of_everyCharacter, riemannHypothesis_of_everyCharacter). Its
only use was UpperTheory.FinalTheorems.riemannHypothesis in MainConclusion,
which nothing uses: Main gets the Riemann Hypothesis from rhOfAll through
Claim.zeta (patch 0001). claimAll in MainTheorems is also unused since
patch 0001. This patch deletes these four theorems. No other declaration
refers to them, and none has an attribute.

The import lines do not change, so the order of modules in the environment
stays the same. RiemannHypothesisOfEveryCharacter.lean stays as a file that
only imports other modules, because three files import it.

